      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563125227,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "hop 3 is inside 100.64.0.0/10 =\nthe ISP's carrier-grade NAT (CGNAT).\nThe ISP shares one public IP\nbetween many customers.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b32",
      "originalText": "hop 3 is inside 100.64.0.0/10 =\nthe ISP's carrier-grade NAT (CGNAT).\nThe ISP shares one public IP\nbetween many customers.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZknrUB06vO-HZx4TfFgav",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 737.20751953125,
      "y": 364,
      "width": 485.5849609375,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1893881695,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 419748863,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794563125227,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At EVERY hop the Layer-2 header (MAC addresses) is rebuilt.\nThe Layer-3 header (IP addresses) stays the same\n... unless a NAT rewrites it.\nThe packet can return by a different path.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b33",
      "originalText": "At EVERY hop the Layer-2 header (MAC addresses) is rebuilt.\nThe Layer-3 header (IP addresses) stays the same\n... unless a NAT rewrites it.\nThe packet can return by a different path.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
